    followUp: "Diabetes clinic in 1 week. Mental health follow-up. Social worker for adherence support. Consider community health worker home visits.",
    pearls: "Recurrent DKA is always a medical and psychosocial emergency. Ask about: insulin access, injection technique, dietary issues, mental health, family support, alcohol/substance use. Every DKA admission is an opportunity to intervene on the root cause. Depression is 2-3x more common in people with diabetes and significantly impacts self-care.",
